{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c7d88ad0313597e9","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery II","source":{"id":"source:reference-c7d88ad0313597e9","title":"Dual Weapon Mastery II","revision":18125,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:37:50Z","sha256":"d291b777a0d868a135151466265336d6a9f8f81e74040baaec88cf810cad87e5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18125","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dual%20Weapon%20Mastery%20II&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c7d88ad0313597e9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a master at fighting with two weapons and double weapons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 15, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +6, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When you attack with two weapons, or with both ends of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Weapon"}," as part of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action, you take a -2 penalty (instead of a -10 penalty) on all attack rolls until the start of your next turn. You only gain this reduced penalty if you are wielding a weapon with which you are proficient. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"}," cannot be used in one hand, so this feat has no effect on them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," If you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action to make more than one attack on your turn, you take a -10 penalty on all attack rolls for the round.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
